# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored extras go in `.dev.vars.local`).
# Do not put production secrets in git. Workers Builds: set matching
# **Build variables** (for NEXT_PUBLIC_* inlining) and Worker **Variables & Secrets**.
# Deploy with `--keep-vars` so dashboard runtime vars are not wiped.

# --- OpenNext / Wrangler ----------------------------------------------------
# Local preview only. Omit in production so Next uses the production env.
NEXTJS_ENV=development

# --- Site URL (replaces VERCEL_URL) -----------------------------------------
# Public origin used for absolute links (llms.txt, Polar checkout fallback).
# Dual-host: Polar checkout uses the request host in the browser.
# Without this: llms.txt links fall back to http://localhost:3020.
NEXT_PUBLIC_URL=https://saas-ui.dev
SITE_URL=https://saas-ui.dev
# Optional extra fallback read by getSiteUrl()
# HOST=https://saas-ui.dev

# --- GitHub -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Stars on the marketing site. Without it: falls back to 1500.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
# Pricing pages fetch starter-kit `updated_at`. Without it: unauthenticated
# GitHub (rate-limited); page still renders with today's date on failure.
GITHUB_PERSONAL_TOKEN=

# --- Polar (saas-js.com checkout) -------------------------------------------
# /checkout and /success. Without it: checkout route cannot create sessions.
POLAR_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# Polar redirect after payment. Without it: Polar uses its default success page.
POLAR_SUCCESS_URL=https://www.saas-js.com/success
# /api/webhooks/polar. Without it: webhook verification throws.
POLAR_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# --- Supabase (Pro registry + entitlement) ----------------------------------
# Private registry items and getProAccess(). Without them: Pro blocks stay
# locked; public registry still works.
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# Client/build fallbacks if the server names above are unset.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_KEY=

# --- Pro registry (blocks gallery) ------------------------------------------
# Remote Pro registry. Defaults to http://localhost:4000/r (empty gallery
# in production if unset).
PRO_REGISTRY_URL=https://registry.saas-ui.pro/r
# Storybook iframe previews. Defaults to http://localhost:6007.
PRO_STORYBOOK_URL=https://storybook.saas-ui.pro
# Entitlement string in Supabase app_metadata. Default: saas-ui-pro
PRO_ENTITLEMENT=saas-ui-pro
# Optional bearer token if the user session has none.
PRO_REGISTRY_TOKEN=

# --- Registry app -----------------------------------------------------------
# Public registry mount. Default: /r (also served under /ui/r for saas-ui.dev).
REGISTRY_BASE_PATH=/r
